      "description": "Our Triathlon Total Knee System portfolio offers you many options to treat patients needing a total knee replacement. The Triathlon single radius is designed to work with the body to promote a natural-like circular motion, to help restore function and relieve pain. Our Triathlon Tritanium Total Knee System is made using AMagine additive manufacturing technology for cementless fixation. To date, the Triathlon single-radius design has helped restore function and relieve knee pain for over 3 million patients.",
